					"nextDialogs": [
						766520504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766520504,
					"content": "不可能…雖然我幫「淘金小弟」新增了說話的功能，但也都是預設的語音…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766520505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "愛諾"
				},
				{
					"id": 766520505,
					"content": "它們不可能像伊涅芙那樣擁有自主意識，畢竟核心完全不是同一個等級…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766520506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "愛諾"
				},
				{
					"id": 766520506,
					"content": "可是它好像可以溝通的樣子，難道是核心升級了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766520507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766520507,
					"content": "你叫什麼名字？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766520508
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766520508,
					"content": "#怎樣？跟{F#妳}{M#你}有什麼關係啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766520509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇怪的淘金小弟"
				},
				{
					"id": 766520509,
					"content": "這傢伙怎麼這麼囂張！簡直像是我們被它抓住了一樣！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766520510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766520510,
					"content": "#不然呢？{F#妳}{M#你}們再不離開，我就把{F#妳}{M#你}們通通抓起來，送進梅洛彼得…！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766520511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇怪的淘金小弟"
				},
				{
					"id": 766520511,
					"content": "梅洛彼得？那是什麼地方？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766520512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊涅芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766520512,
					"content": "就是、就是…就是…咦？梅洛彼得什麼…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766520513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇怪的淘金小弟"
				},
				{
					"id": 766520513,
					"content": "梅洛彼得堡？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766520514
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766520514,
					"content": "梅洛彼得堡…好像是這個名字…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766520515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇怪的淘金小弟"
				},
				{
					"id": 766520515,
					"content": "你是從楓丹來的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766520516
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766520516,
					"content": "幹嘛？不要一上來就打聽女孩子的私生活！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766520517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇怪的淘金小弟"
				},
				{
					"id": 766520517,
					"content": "喂！什麼女孩子，你不是個垃圾分類機器人嗎？",
